On 05/12/2017 09:08, Maxime Ripard wrote:
> On Mon, Dec 04, 2017 at 03:12:49PM +0100, Quentin Schulz wrote:
>> This makes the axp20x_adc driver probe with platform device id
>> "axp813-adc".
>>
